  "markdown": "[Skip to main content](https://avispl.com/industries/healthcare/#main-content)\n\n# HealthcareAudio  VisualTechnology\n\nImprove patient outcomes and employee satisfaction with healthcare simulation, telemedicine, and collaboration technology.\n\nScroll to bottom of the hero section\n\n![doctor using VR headset for healthcare research](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/iStock-1287840962.webp)\n\n### Immersive audio visual healthcare solutions\n\nSecure, reliable, and immersive audio visual communications solutions for healthcare organizations.\n\n[Contact Us](https://avispl.com/industries/healthcare/#contact)\n\n### Healthcare\n\nHealthcare\n\nSimulation Training\n\nTelemedicine\n\nHybrid\n\ncollaboration spaces\n\n![manikin for healthcare simulation training](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/10_16_18_Whitlock118373-scaled.webp)\n\nIncrease patient safety with healthcare simulation environments. Experiential technology solutions help mimic stress, situations, and patient responses.\n\n[Explore](https://avispl.com/solutions/simulation/)\n\n![patient using a tablet for a telemedicine video call](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/iStock-1419932307-telemedicine-1-scaled.webp)\n\nEnhance access to healthcare and provide services in a safe, secure remote environment with telemedicine technology.\n\n[Explore](https://avispl.com/industries/healthcare/#contact)\n\n![doctors in a hybrid meeting with a remote team and x-ray on the screen](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/iStock-1323582838-medical-team-hybrid-meeting-scaled.webp)\n\nModern training and meeting rooms help attract and retain top medical talent and improve patient outcomes.\n\n[Explore](https://avispl.com/solutions/meeting-rooms/)\n\n### Patient, Staff, and    Organizational Benefits\n\n![Healthcare team in white coats and scrubs gathers around a table, holding a clipboard and stethoscope, engaged in discussion.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/iStock-1350731849-close-up-of-doctors-scaled.webp)\n\n#### Improve Patient Outcomes\n\nImprove skills in controlled environments to reduce errors and enhance patient safety.\n\n#### Enhance Employee Experience\n\nGive healthcare professionals the modern tools to collaborate and coordinate patient care.\n\n#### Flexibility\n\nCustomize your healthcare audiovisual technology to meet your team’s needs.\n\n![Modern office with digital display wall, geometric decor in red, black, gold; blurred figures; open space with seating and work areas.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/McDonalds-image65.jpg)\n\n### Why Partner with AVI-SPL?\n\n- Increase cost savings and better ROI\n- Enhance patient outcomes\n- Improve reliability, ease of use, and user experience\n- Leverage AI-enabled meeting tools\n- Rely on 24/7 global technology help desk and managed services\n\nOur Services\n\n### Wemanageandsupport  youraudio-visual,unified  communicationsystem\n\n[Contact](https://avispl.com/industries/healthcare/#contact)\n\n[![A woman at a desk joins a video call on a laptop with four smiling people, holding a pen and notebook by charts and papers.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Voice-cloud-calling-Img-v2-1024x683.jpg)\\\\\n\\\\\n**Video Production**](https://avispl.com/services/video-production/) [![A technician in a black shirt examines cables by server racks in a tech-filled room with a tiled ceiling, creating an industrial vibe.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Support-and-Maintenance-1024x683.jpg)\\\\\n\\\\\n**Support and Maintenance**](https://avispl.com/services/support-and-maintenance/) [![Lecture hall with rows of chairs, tables facing screens showing AVI-SPL logo; overhead lights, exit signs visible.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Rose-State-Colleges-Tanenbaum-Aerospace-and-Cybersecurity-Center-tiered-lecture-hall-with-Epson-projectors-on-1024x594.jpg)\\\\\n\\\\\n**Professional Services**](https://avispl.com/services/professional-services/)\n\n12\n\n![Woman in orange blouse on video call, holding paper. Notebooks and pen on desk; airy room with plants in background.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/content-module-1.jpg)\n\nCase Studies\n\n### Secure Customer Meetings and Collaboration\n\nHow we helped create secure workspaces at a non-profit.\n\n[View More](https://avispl.com/resources/case-studies/united-states-naval-institute/)\n\n### Partners\n\nWe partner with leading collaboration providers.\n\n[![cisco logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/cisco-seeklogo-1.svg)](https://avispl.com/cisco/)[![crestron logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Creston-Logo-2.svg)](https://avispl.com/crestron/)[![Google logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/google-Logo-1.svg)](https://avispl.com/google/)[![HP Poly logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/hp-poly-large.svg)](https://avispl.com/hp-poly/)[![Logitech Logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/logitech-Logo-2.svg)](https://avispl.com/logitech/)[![Microsoft logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/microsoft-Logo-1.svg)](https://avispl.com/microsoft/)[![Neat logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Neat-logo.svg)](https://avispl.com/neat/)[![Q-SYS logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/q-sys.svg)](https://avispl.com/q-sys/)[![Sennheiser logo: stylized S icon on the left, followed by bold SENNHEISER in capitals. Simple black and white design.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Sennheiser-Logo.png)](https://avispl.com/sennheiser/)[![zoom-logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/zoom-logo.svg)](https://avispl.com/zoom/)\n\n[![cisco logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/cisco-seeklogo-1.svg)](https://avispl.com/cisco/)[![crestron logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Creston-Logo-2.svg)](https://avispl.com/crestron/)[![Google logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/1